!define FAIL_COLOR #FFCCCC
!define SUCCESS_COLOR #CCFFCC
!define WARNING_COLOR #FFFFCC

title Database Connection Flow - Before vs After Fix

|#FAIL_COLOR|Before Fix (Broken)|
start
:User sets DB path in UI\ne.g., "D:\\MyData\\project.db";
note right
  Configuration stored but
  **NEVER USED** ❌
end note

:FetchData calls\nConnect.getConnection(dbLocation);

:**IGNORES parameter**\nHardcoded path used instead;
